{% comment %}
  ============================================
  SECTION 4 — WHY THIS WORKS WHEN NOTHING ELSE DID
  Whipped Tallow & Honey Balm
  ============================================

  HOW TO USE:
  1. Go to Online Store → Themes → Customize
  2. Add a "Custom Liquid" block on the product page
  3. Paste this entire file into the Custom Liquid box

  IMAGE PLACEHOLDER:
  Replace IMAGE_URL_HERE with the texture swatch on hand image.
  Upload your image to Shopify → Settings → Files and copy the URL.

  BRAND COLORS:
  - Primary teal: #2d6b5d
  - Cream bg: #f7f3ed

  MOBILE OPTIMIZED — short paragraphs, generous spacing
  ============================================
{% endcomment %}

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  .section-why-works {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 48px auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
    color: #2a2a2a;
  }

  .section-why-works__header {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-why-works__image {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
    display: block;
  }

  .section-why-works__body {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-why-works__para {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: #2a2a2a;
  }

  .section-why-works__highlight {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #2d6b5d;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 28px 0;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-left: 3px solid #2d6b5d;
    background: #f7f3ed;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .section-why-works {
      margin: 32px auto;
    }
    .section-why-works__header {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .section-why-works__para {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .section-why-works__highlight {
      font-size: 19px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
  }
</style>

<section class="section-why-works">
  <h2 class="section-why-works__header">Dry skin isn't always<br>missing water.</h2>

  {% comment %} REPLACE IMAGE_URL_HERE WITH TEXTURE SWATCH ON HAND IMAGE {% endcomment %}
  <img
    src="IMAGE_URL_HERE"
    alt="Tallow balm absorbing into skin"
    class="section-why-works__image"
  >

  <div class="section-why-works__body">
    <p class="section-why-works__para">
      Skin makes its own oil. It always has. It's the thing a 25-year-old's face holds onto without thinking about it.
    </p>

    <p class="section-why-works__para">
      After about 40, skin makes a lot less of that oil. That's when most women start noticing their old routine stopped holding the way it used to.
    </p>

    <p class="section-why-works__para">
      Here's the thing about most creams. They add water. Water can't replace oil.
    </p>

    <p class="section-why-works__highlight">
      Only oil can replace oil.
    </p>

    <p class="section-why-works__para">
      Tallow is almost the same fat skin makes on its own. Same kind of fat. Same structure.
    </p>

    <p class="section-why-works__para">
      So when you put it on, it doesn't sit on top like a regular cream. It absorbs in. The body recognizes it.
    </p>

    <p class="section-why-works__para">
      That's the difference between a cream that disappears by noon and one that holds all day.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
